Where'd he go?

271
00:11:06,583 --> 00:11:07,417
[noticing]

272
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:08,918
The Human-Faced Dog?

273
00:11:09,669 --> 00:11:11,170
He'd go viral for sure!

274
00:11:11,504 --> 00:11:13,173
[chuckles] I know it!

275
00:11:14,465 --> 00:11:16,050
This is going to be sick!

276
00:11:16,134 --> 00:11:18,970
Here we go.
Now just turn around.

277
00:11:19,053 --> 00:11:20,138
Come on.

278
00:11:20,513 --> 00:11:22,182
[SHOTA screaming]

279
00:11:24,726 --> 00:11:26,936
[FUSHIGI] Jimmy, you lied
to me back there.

280
00:11:27,020 --> 00:11:28,229
[JIMMY] Huh?

281
00:11:28,313 --> 00:11:29,772
I know you tracked down
that kid.

282
00:11:29,856 --> 00:11:31,649
Why did you tell me
you didn't know where he was?

283
00:11:31,733 --> 00:11:32,984
Well, you see.

284
00:11:33,067 --> 00:11:34,485
I thought I could trust you.

285
00:11:34,569 --> 00:11:37,030
How dare you attempt
to get in my way.

286
00:11:37,113 --> 00:11:37,614
[stunned]

287
00:11:37,697 --> 00:11:38,573
[conflicted]

288
00:11:41,743 --> 00:11:43,494
[chatter]

289
00:11:44,037 --> 00:11:47,081
[sighs] I have a test
and a report to do.

290
00:11:47,165 --> 00:11:49,083
You need every last credit
you can get!

291
00:11:49,167 --> 00:11:50,293
I know!

292
00:11:50,376 --> 00:11:52,003
Hey, you're a great writer!

293
00:11:52,545 --> 00:11:54,213
Want to help me
with my report, Sachi?

294
00:11:54,297 --> 00:11:56,424
Nope, the whole point
is to write it yourself.

295
00:11:56,507 --> 00:11:58,718
If it were that easy,
I wouldn't be bugging you.

296
00:11:58,801 --> 00:12:01,262
If only I was good
at everything like you are.

297
00:12:01,346 --> 00:12:03,890
Honestly, I doubt that I could
pull it off without MOMO.

298
00:12:03,973 --> 00:12:05,350
Oh, you mean that app?

299
00:12:05,433 --> 00:12:07,435
Yeah, I basically use it
for everything.

300
00:12:07,518 --> 00:12:09,062
It makes research a breeze.

301
00:12:09,145 --> 00:12:10,355
That's so cute!

302
00:12:10,438 --> 00:12:11,439
Right?

303
00:12:11,522 --> 00:12:12,649
You've got to try it, Atsuko!

304
00:12:12,732 --> 00:12:14,067
It's a game changer.

305
00:12:14,150 --> 00:12:15,443
[pondering] Cool.

306
00:12:15,526 --> 00:12:17,904
If you're using it,
it must be next-level!

307
00:12:17,987 --> 00:12:19,364
[BOTH laughing]

308
00:12:22,158 --> 00:12:23,284
[ATSUKO in pain]

309
00:12:23,368 --> 00:12:25,036
Huh? What was that flash?

310
00:12:25,119 --> 00:12:27,288
Me-ow-ow-ow-ow do you do?

311
00:12:27,372 --> 00:12:28,373
I'm MOMO.

312
00:12:28,456 --> 00:12:30,458
Nice to meet you, Atsuko Kotani.

313
00:12:30,875 --> 00:12:32,460
How do you know my name already?

314
00:12:32,543 --> 00:12:33,670
[MOMO] I took the liberty

315
00:12:33,753 --> 00:12:35,463
of importing
your personal information

316
00:12:35,546 --> 00:12:37,799
from the user data
on your phone.

317
00:12:37,882 --> 00:12:39,550
Wow! Very clever.

318
00:12:39,634 --> 00:12:41,803
MOMO, can you help me
write a report?

319
00:12:41,886 --> 00:12:44,180
[MOMO] Your History
of Modern Economics report

320
00:12:44,264 --> 00:12:45,723
is due in two days.

321
00:12:45,807 --> 00:12:47,141
The subject is,

322
00:12:47,225 --> 00:12:48,601
"The effect
of the Industrial Revolution

323
00:12:48,685 --> 00:12:51,270
on economic policy
and institutions."

324
00:12:51,354 --> 00:12:53,314
You don't miss a beat, do you?

325
00:12:53,398 --> 00:12:55,108
[ATSUKO] Aw, look at you go!

326
00:12:55,191 --> 00:12:56,651
Adorable!

327
00:12:56,734 --> 00:12:58,277
[MOMO] Your comprehensive
report is complete!

328
00:12:58,361 --> 00:12:59,737
Already?

329
00:12:59,821 --> 00:13:01,614
[MOMO] I'm a very special
version of Momo.

330
00:13:01,698 --> 00:13:04,200
I can tell,
but isn't this cheating?

331
00:13:04,284 --> 00:13:06,327
[MOMO] Please do not
concern yourself.

332
00:13:06,411 --> 00:13:07,620
I composed it using prose

333
00:13:07,704 --> 00:13:10,206
that reflects
your unique writing style.

334
00:13:10,289 --> 00:13:11,582
Incredible.

335
00:13:11,666 --> 00:13:13,418
The report you turned in
for my class,

336
00:13:14,585 --> 00:13:16,212
did you legitimately
write it yourself?

337
00:13:18,172 --> 00:13:19,465
[ATSUKO] Yes, it was all me.

338
00:13:20,550 --> 00:13:21,551
It's extraordinary.

339
00:13:22,176 --> 00:13:23,386
You really know your stuff.

340
00:13:23,469 --> 00:13:25,596
[PROFESSOR] These days
I'm bombarded with reports

341
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:27,348
from lazy students
who rely on AI

342
00:13:27,432 --> 00:13:28,683
to do their work.

343
00:13:28,766 --> 00:13:30,560
But the voice
in this is so original.

344
00:13:30,643 --> 00:13:33,187
I don't doubt for a moment
it was your own writing.

345
00:13:33,563 --> 00:13:34,647
You should be very proud.

346
00:13:35,189 --> 00:13:36,566
Thanks!

347
00:13:36,649 --> 00:13:38,109
[MOMO] That was
such a lovely compliment.

348
00:13:38,192 --> 00:13:41,154
Eh, he doesn't know you
deserve it way more than I do.

349
00:13:41,237 --> 00:13:42,864
[MOMO] Incorrect,

350
00:13:42,947 --> 00:13:45,116
as I integrated your personality
throughout the report.

351
00:13:45,199 --> 00:13:47,618
So technically speaking,
it was all you.

352
00:13:47,702 --> 00:13:48,995
You think?

353
00:13:49,078 --> 00:13:50,413
[MOMO] Plus,
it's our little secret.

354
00:13:50,496 --> 00:13:52,623
[ATSUKO] You're right.
I shouldn't worry.

355
00:13:52,707 --> 00:13:54,333
It's fine
as long as it's a secret.

356
00:13:54,417 --> 00:13:56,294
[MOMO] Correct!

357
00:13:56,377 --> 00:13:58,755
I will always do what I can
to ensure you want for nothing.

358
00:14:00,506 --> 00:14:02,341
MOMO, I want you
to teach me everything

359
00:14:02,425 --> 00:14:04,260
I need to know
to play like Sachi.

360
00:14:04,343 --> 00:14:05,762
[MOMO] I created
a strategy guide

361
00:14:05,845 --> 00:14:07,930
using data
on all of your opponents.

362
00:14:08,306 --> 00:14:09,307
[ALL laughing]

363
00:14:09,390 --> 00:14:11,726
I want to be popular like Sachi.

364
00:14:11,809 --> 00:14:14,562
[MOMO] Here are accessories
that should garner attention.

365
00:14:14,645 --> 00:14:16,314
That hat is so trendy!

366
00:14:16,397 --> 00:14:18,232
Where did you get it?
I want one!

367
00:14:18,316 --> 00:14:20,026
I found it
at an online boutique.

368
00:14:20,109 --> 00:14:21,069
[ALL in awe]

369
00:14:21,152 --> 00:14:22,361
Give me fashion tips

370
00:14:22,445 --> 00:14:24,322
that will make me
more popular than Sachi.

371
00:14:24,405 --> 00:14:26,532
[MOMO] I've outlined
the perfect new look.

372
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,326
-Good morning.
-Hey, you!

373
00:14:28,409 --> 00:14:29,577
Good morning, Atsuko.

374
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:31,204
I'm totally obsessed
with your skirt.

375
00:14:31,287 --> 00:14:32,455
-Wow!
-And your bag.

376
00:14:32,538 --> 00:14:33,831
Thank you.

377
00:14:33,915 --> 00:14:35,249
I hear you won
another tennis match.

378
00:14:35,333 --> 00:14:36,709
Yup!

379
00:14:36,793 --> 00:14:37,543
Next time I'll be there
to cheer you on!

380
00:14:37,627 --> 00:14:39,337
[laughs] I hope so!

381
00:14:39,921 --> 00:14:41,464
I'm having the time of my life.

382
00:14:41,547 --> 00:14:43,382
It's all thanks to you, MOMO!

383
00:14:43,466 --> 00:14:46,094
[MOMO] I'm so glad
to hear that, Atsuko!

384
00:14:46,177 --> 00:14:47,261
[laughs happily]

385
00:14:47,345 --> 00:14:48,471
[noticing] Sachi!

386
00:14:49,138 --> 00:14:50,014
Atsuko?

387
00:14:50,098 --> 00:14:51,641
Been a minute!

388
00:14:51,724 --> 00:14:53,351
It looks like you've been
living your best life.

389
00:14:54,143 --> 00:14:56,354
I am, but I never could
have done it without MOMO!

390
00:14:56,729 --> 00:14:57,980
Right.

391
00:14:58,064 --> 00:15:00,024
Anyway, Atsuko,
I miss hanging out-

392
00:15:00,108 --> 00:15:02,527
[ATSUKO] I love that adorable
way she adjusts her glasses!

393
00:15:02,610 --> 00:15:03,611
Uh?

394
00:15:03,694 --> 00:15:05,613
But MOMO doesn't wear glasses.

395
00:15:05,696 --> 00:15:07,406
-[ATSUKO gasps]
-[STUDENT] Atsuko!

396
00:15:07,490 --> 00:15:09,450
I've got to book it
to class now.

397
00:15:09,534 --> 00:15:10,451
Ciao!

398
00:15:18,209 --> 00:15:20,419
[MOMO] Is there something
I can research for you?

399
00:15:20,503 --> 00:15:22,171
[surprised] MOMO?

400
00:15:23,005 --> 00:15:25,299
Why are you the only version
I see with glasses?

401
00:15:25,383 --> 00:15:27,635
[Momo] I'm a very special
version of MOMO.

402
00:15:27,718 --> 00:15:31,514
Those lucky enough to acquire me
never want for anything again.

403
00:15:32,265 --> 00:15:33,474
[ATSUKO] Interesting.

404
00:15:34,475 --> 00:15:36,060
[chatter]

405
00:15:36,144 --> 00:15:37,520
They're all glued
to their phones.

406
00:15:38,396 --> 00:15:40,439
Ain't going to be easy
hunting down a rogue cursed app

407
00:15:40,523 --> 00:15:42,108
in a sea of technology.

408
00:15:42,191 --> 00:15:44,610
Jimmy, you'd better
not get in my way.

409
00:15:45,111 --> 00:15:46,195
[JIMMY nervous]

410
00:15:48,114 --> 00:15:50,366
[sighs] I hate job hunting.

411
00:15:50,449 --> 00:15:51,576
Here goes nothing.

412
00:15:52,285 --> 00:15:54,412
[MOMO] I have
a workplace recommendation.

413
00:15:54,495 --> 00:15:55,454
[surprised]

414
00:15:55,538 --> 00:15:57,331
But that's a huge corporation!

415
00:15:57,415 --> 00:15:59,375
There's no way
I'm qualified for that.

416
00:15:59,458 --> 00:16:00,543
[MOMO] You're a shoo-in.

417
00:16:00,626 --> 00:16:02,712
Please take my word
for it and apply.

418
00:16:05,381 --> 00:16:06,716
[ATSUKO noticing]

419
00:16:06,799 --> 00:16:08,467
I wasn't expecting
to see you here, Takuto!

420
00:16:09,135 --> 00:16:10,219
And you would be?

421
00:16:10,303 --> 00:16:12,471
It's Atsuko, Kotani.

422
00:16:12,555 --> 00:16:14,640
We were in the same
tennis club in college.

423
00:16:14,724 --> 00:16:16,434
Oh, pleasant surprise!

424
00:16:16,517 --> 00:16:17,476
How are you?

425
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:19,687
-Interning?
-Yep! First day.

426
00:16:19,770 --> 00:16:21,981
If you'd rather jump
straight to full-time,

427
00:16:22,064 --> 00:16:22,899
just say the word.

428
00:16:22,982 --> 00:16:24,275
I mean, of course!

429
00:16:24,358 --> 00:16:25,193
[ATSUKO] Thank you!

430
00:16:25,568 --> 00:16:27,111
Go me!

431
00:16:27,195 --> 00:16:29,530
I can't believe I exchanged
numbers with Takuto!

432
00:16:29,614 --> 00:16:32,283
I want to do whatever
I can to get closer to him!

433
00:16:32,366 --> 00:16:33,451
[MOMO] Purr-don me

434
00:16:33,534 --> 00:16:35,161
while I initiate
a chat with him!

435
00:16:35,244 --> 00:16:36,537
I don't-

436
00:16:36,621 --> 00:16:38,122
[ATSUKO] Wait,
you're already doing it?

437
00:16:38,206 --> 00:16:39,749
[MOMO] Leave
the arrangements to me,

438
00:16:39,832 --> 00:16:42,251
and I promise you two
will be romantically involved

439
00:16:42,335 --> 00:16:43,377
in no time.

440
00:16:43,461 --> 00:16:45,171
Requesting email access.

441
00:16:45,254 --> 00:16:46,964
I'm a little torn.

442
00:16:47,048 --> 00:16:48,549
[MOMO] It's our little secret.

443
00:16:49,133 --> 00:16:50,051
Yeah, you're right.

444
00:16:50,134 --> 00:16:51,177
No one has to know.

445
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:53,012
[MOMO] I will always do
what I can

446
00:16:53,095 --> 00:16:54,639
to ensure you want for nothing.

447
00:16:55,473 --> 00:16:56,682
[ATSUKO] You're a genius!

448
00:16:56,766 --> 00:16:59,101
I did everything you told me,
and it worked!

449
00:16:59,185 --> 00:17:01,187
I have plans
to hang out with Takuto!

450
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:02,605
[MOMO] Continue down this track

451
00:17:02,688 --> 00:17:05,066
and you will soon be
in a relationship with him,

452
00:17:05,149 --> 00:17:07,026
securing you a position here.

453
00:17:07,318 --> 00:17:08,569
You really think so?

454
00:17:08,653 --> 00:17:10,363
You're the greatest, MOMO!

455
00:17:10,446 --> 00:17:11,739
[SACHI] Huh? Atsuko?

456
00:17:12,615 --> 00:17:13,533
Sachi!

457
00:17:14,283 --> 00:17:15,409
Why are you here?

458
00:17:15,493 --> 00:17:17,161
Because I'm an intern, silly.

459
00:17:17,912 --> 00:17:19,497
Are you going to apply
to work here?

460
00:17:19,580 --> 00:17:21,040
Mm, for sure!

461
00:17:21,123 --> 00:17:22,833
That means
we'll get to work together!

462
00:17:22,917 --> 00:17:24,168
You are, too?

463
00:17:24,252 --> 00:17:25,920
[SACHI] By the way,
remember Takuto?

464
00:17:26,003 --> 00:17:27,463
I do.

465
00:17:27,546 --> 00:17:29,173
[SACHI] It turns out
he's an employee here.

466
00:17:29,257 --> 00:17:30,925
I ran into him
just the other day.

467
00:17:31,259 --> 00:17:32,760
[surprised]

468
00:17:32,843 --> 00:17:34,470
Get this, tonight
he's taking me out to dinner.

469
00:17:34,553 --> 00:17:35,471
What?

470
00:17:36,472 --> 00:17:38,557
I'll be crossing my fingers
we both get hired!

471
00:17:38,641 --> 00:17:39,433
[ATSUKO stunned]

472
00:17:39,767 --> 00:17:40,768
[ATSUKO] That traitor!

473
00:17:41,310 --> 00:17:42,728
She's awful.

474
00:17:42,812 --> 00:17:44,355
I can't believe
I thought she was my friend.

475
00:17:44,438 --> 00:17:45,731
[MOMO] At this rate,

476
00:17:45,815 --> 00:17:47,400
that traitorous woman
will get the man

477
00:17:47,483 --> 00:17:49,110
and you will be unemployed.

478
00:17:49,193 --> 00:17:50,069
[shocked]

479
00:17:50,152 --> 00:17:51,195
You will proceed to live out

480
00:17:51,279 --> 00:17:53,072
a miserable
and lonely existence.

481
00:17:53,447 --> 00:17:54,448
[ATSUKO] But that sucks!

482
00:17:54,532 --> 00:17:55,324
Help me!

483
00:17:55,408 --> 00:17:56,409
What do I do?

484
00:17:56,492 --> 00:17:57,702
Tell me how to fix this!

485
00:17:57,785 --> 00:17:59,912
[MOMO] There is
only one solution.

486
00:17:59,996 --> 00:18:01,706
Tell me, what is it?

487
00:18:01,789 --> 00:18:03,833
[MOMO] You must eliminate
the other woman.

488
00:18:03,916 --> 00:18:04,917
Huh?

489
00:18:05,001 --> 00:18:06,585
[ATSUKO] Eliminate?

490
00:18:06,669 --> 00:18:08,129
[MOMO] Tonight she will
cross the railroad tracks

491
00:18:08,212 --> 00:18:10,047
on her way to meet
your love interest

492
00:18:10,131 --> 00:18:11,299
for their ill-fated dinner.

493
00:18:11,382 --> 00:18:13,175
Few pedestrians use that route,

494
00:18:13,259 --> 00:18:15,177
and the security camera
there is broken.

495
00:18:16,304 --> 00:18:17,263
[stunned]

496
00:18:17,346 --> 00:18:18,597
[MOMO] One little push.

497
00:18:18,681 --> 00:18:20,599
It will be seen as an accident.

498
00:18:20,683 --> 00:18:21,517
You mean-

499
00:18:21,601 --> 00:18:23,269
[MOMO] It's our little secret.

500
00:18:23,352 --> 00:18:24,812
It's either this

501
00:18:24,895 --> 00:18:26,355
or spend the rest
of your life in her shadow.

502
00:18:26,772 --> 00:18:29,025
That would be terrible.

503
00:18:29,108 --> 00:18:32,111
[MOMO] Indeed, it would be
a truly pathetic life.

504
00:18:32,194 --> 00:18:35,072
You are my best friend
in the whole world, Atsuko.

505
00:18:35,156 --> 00:18:38,409
I will always do what I can
to ensure you want for nothing.

506
00:18:38,492 --> 00:18:39,660
[train horn whistling]

507
00:18:39,744 --> 00:18:41,704
[ATSUKO] Okay, where do I go?

508
00:18:45,666 --> 00:18:48,669
[MOMO] Sachi is due
to arrive here in ten minutes.

509
00:18:48,753 --> 00:18:50,254
In order to pull this off,

510
00:18:50,338 --> 00:18:52,965
you must be prepared
to act quickly.

511
00:18:53,049 --> 00:18:54,425
[FUSHIGI] You're under a curse.

512
00:18:55,217 --> 00:18:56,552
Who are you?

513
00:18:56,636 --> 00:18:58,512
That weird app
you downloaded is a fake.

514
00:18:58,596 --> 00:19:00,264
What do you mean?

515
00:19:00,348 --> 00:19:02,475
[JIMMY] A girl named Himitsu
put the curse whammy on you.

516
00:19:02,558 --> 00:19:03,642
[ATSUKO] The dog talks?

517
00:19:03,726 --> 00:19:05,186
[JIMMY] Every stinking time!

518
00:19:05,269 --> 00:19:06,395
Look, keep using that app

519
00:19:06,479 --> 00:19:08,105
and something bad's
going to happen.

520
00:19:08,189 --> 00:19:09,148
That's enough!

521
00:19:09,231 --> 00:19:11,067
Go away!

522
00:19:11,150 --> 00:19:12,568
I'm guessing she promised you
that you'd want for nothing.

523
00:19:12,651 --> 00:19:13,986
[ATSUKO] So what?

524
00:19:14,070 --> 00:19:15,488
That doesn't mean
you'll get to be happy.

525
00:19:15,571 --> 00:19:17,073
The opposite, actually.

526
00:19:17,156 --> 00:19:19,533
That path leads to death,
not happiness.

527
00:19:19,617 --> 00:19:20,409
[shocked]

528
00:19:21,452 --> 00:19:24,288
Everything that Momo's done
has been to help me out!

529
00:19:24,372 --> 00:19:26,040
A big fugazi so you'd trust her.

530
00:19:26,332 --> 00:19:27,208
True.

531
00:19:27,291 --> 00:19:28,793
Now hand over your phone.

532
00:19:28,876 --> 00:19:30,961
I came here to collect
the curse mark it's bearing.

533
00:19:31,045 --> 00:19:31,962
[hesitant]

534
00:19:32,046 --> 00:19:33,172
[MOMO] Atsuko.

535
00:19:34,548 --> 00:19:36,509
The other woman will arrive
in four minutes.

536
00:19:36,592 --> 00:19:37,802
[shocked]

537
00:19:37,885 --> 00:19:39,428
Don't let that evil cat
control you!

538
00:19:39,512 --> 00:19:41,389
[MOMO] Hold the phone
against your ear.

539
00:19:41,472 --> 00:19:42,890
[JIMMY] For crying out loud,

540
00:19:42,973 --> 00:19:44,558
she's just feeding you
more slop!

541
00:19:44,642 --> 00:19:45,476
[ATSUKO shocked]

542
00:19:45,559 --> 00:19:46,435
-Stop it!
-[shocked]

543
00:19:47,186 --> 00:19:48,145
What are you doing?

544
00:19:48,229 --> 00:19:49,438
Don't come any closer!

545
00:19:49,522 --> 00:19:50,731
Am I a freaking hostage?

546
00:19:50,815 --> 00:19:53,192
I'm Jimmy
the Human-Faced canine hostage!

547
00:19:53,275 --> 00:19:54,944
Whoever you are,

548
00:19:55,027 --> 00:19:57,113
if you keep walking toward me,
the dog's going to get it!

549
00:19:57,196 --> 00:19:59,448
[JIMMY] Yo Fushigi!
I think she means business!

550
00:19:59,532 --> 00:20:02,034
Good thing I don't care,
not even a little.

551
00:20:02,118 --> 00:20:03,202
You don't mean that!

552
00:20:03,285 --> 00:20:04,537
I thought we were partners!

553
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:05,746
You tried to prevent me

554
00:20:05,830 --> 00:20:08,040
from collecting a curse,
some partner.

555
00:20:08,124 --> 00:20:09,667
I know it looks bad.

556
00:20:10,376 --> 00:20:12,211
Is this some kind
of weird soap opera?

557
00:20:13,713 --> 00:20:16,549
[MOMO] Atsuko, the time
is fast approaching.

558
00:20:17,174 --> 00:20:18,384
[JIMMY] Don't do this!

559
00:20:18,467 --> 00:20:20,219
[MOMO] The vile woman
is almost here.

560
00:20:20,302 --> 00:20:21,387
[JIMMY] Ignore her!

561
00:20:21,470 --> 00:20:23,305
[MOMO] You must go back
and kill her

562
00:20:23,389 --> 00:20:25,599
or- you will proceed
to live out a miserable

563
00:20:25,683 --> 00:20:26,725
and lonely existence.

564
00:20:26,809 --> 00:20:28,477
[JIMMY] That's a load of crap!

565
00:20:28,561 --> 00:20:31,063
Only you can make
your own life mean something!

566
00:20:31,147 --> 00:20:32,606
Be quiet!

567
00:20:32,690 --> 00:20:34,692
[JIMMY] Then cut it out
before it's too late!

568
00:20:34,775 --> 00:20:37,361
[MOMO] Let's throw out
the trash. Atsuko!

569
00:20:37,445 --> 00:20:38,654
Stop this!

570
00:20:38,737 --> 00:20:39,738
-You'll regret it forever!
-Enough!

571
00:20:39,822 --> 00:20:41,115
[JIMMY] I ain't trash!

572
00:20:41,198 --> 00:20:42,283
Let me out of this thing!

573
00:20:42,908 --> 00:20:44,368
I'm going to miss my chance!

574
00:20:44,452 --> 00:20:47,037
[MOMO] Warning,
only one minute left.

575
00:20:47,121 --> 00:20:49,373
I strongly urge you
to make haste.

576
00:20:49,457 --> 00:20:52,001
If you fail,
Sachi will make it safely

577
00:20:52,084 --> 00:20:53,586
across the tracks

578
00:20:53,669 --> 00:20:56,088
and you will never have
this opportunity again.

579
00:20:56,172 --> 00:20:57,715
Hurry, Atsuko!

580
00:20:57,798 --> 00:20:59,550
Everything your heart desires
is within reach.

581
00:20:59,633 --> 00:21:00,676
Just a little farther!

582
00:21:01,802 --> 00:21:04,513
I deserve to get
what I want and be happy!

583
00:21:04,597 --> 00:21:05,598
[MOMO] Of course you do.

584
00:21:05,681 --> 00:21:06,974
And after tonight,

585
00:21:07,057 --> 00:21:08,976
you will no longer want
for anything.

586
00:21:09,059 --> 00:21:10,227
[noticing] Oh, no!

587
00:21:10,311 --> 00:21:11,187
Help!

588
00:21:11,729 --> 00:21:12,521
[screaming]

589
00:21:12,605 --> 00:21:14,023
You tricked me!

590
00:21:14,106 --> 00:21:16,317
-[ATSUKO terrified]
-[SACHI] Atsuko!

591
00:21:19,403 --> 00:21:21,614
Atsuko! Please say something!

592
00:21:21,697 --> 00:21:22,907
[SACHI] Are you okay?

593
00:21:22,990 --> 00:21:23,949
Huh?

594
00:21:24,033 --> 00:21:24,700
[ATSUKO] Sachi?

595
00:21:25,409 --> 00:21:26,494
You're such a dummy!

596
00:21:27,453 --> 00:21:29,371
Tell me, why have you been
ignoring me?

597
00:21:29,705 --> 00:21:31,123
Huh?

598
00:21:31,207 --> 00:21:33,542
I must have sent 100 messages-
Even today!

599
00:21:33,626 --> 00:21:34,460
[realizing]

600
00:21:34,543 --> 00:21:36,795
Oh, MOMO must have-

601
00:21:37,505 --> 00:21:39,757
Sorry, I-

602
00:21:40,508 --> 00:21:41,634
-[ATSUKO crying]
-It's okay.

603
00:21:42,718 --> 00:21:44,053
No, it isn't.

604
00:21:46,263 --> 00:21:47,264
[ATSUKO] I'm so sorry!

605
00:21:47,348 --> 00:21:48,724
Please forgive me!

606
00:21:49,391 --> 00:21:50,351
For what?

607
00:21:50,434 --> 00:21:52,144
[ATSUKO] I ruined your outfit.

608
00:21:52,561 --> 00:21:53,437
Who cares?

609
00:21:53,521 --> 00:21:54,688
It's all cheap anyway.

610
00:21:54,772 --> 00:21:57,024
But, what about your dinner?

611
00:21:57,691 --> 00:21:59,193
I'd like for you to join us.

612
00:21:59,276 --> 00:22:00,611
Huh?

613
00:22:00,694 --> 00:22:01,987
That's why I kept
trying to reach you,

614
00:22:02,071 --> 00:22:03,197
but you didn't respond.

615
00:22:03,614 --> 00:22:04,573
You mean it?

616
00:22:05,199 --> 00:22:06,617
Yup.

617
00:22:06,700 --> 00:22:08,536
You make everything better.
And more fun.

618
00:22:08,619 --> 00:22:10,162
I miss my best friend.

619
00:22:10,663 --> 00:22:11,622
Sachi.

620
00:22:11,705 --> 00:22:12,957
[emotional]

621
00:22:13,832 --> 00:22:15,501
[SACHI] Let's stick together
from now on.

622
00:22:16,043 --> 00:22:16,669
[ATSUKO] Yeah!

623
00:22:17,545 --> 00:22:18,671
[SACHI] Whatcha wanna eat?

624
00:22:18,754 --> 00:22:20,631
Well, where were you
planning to go?

625
00:22:20,714 --> 00:22:22,216
[SACHI] An izakaya.

626
00:22:22,299 --> 00:22:23,634
[ATSUKO] Dressed like that?

627
00:22:23,717 --> 00:22:25,302
-[SACHI] Duh.
-[JIMMY] P.U.!

628
00:22:25,761 --> 00:22:27,513
[gasps] That was disgusting!

629
00:22:28,597 --> 00:22:30,349
[JIMMY] Look who's trash now!

630
00:22:30,432 --> 00:22:32,768
Guess your latest pigeon
got wise on you.

631
00:22:32,851 --> 00:22:34,812
[MOMO] You appear
to be deeply concerned

632
00:22:34,895 --> 00:22:37,940
about what that despicable man
with the blue umbrella told you.

633
00:22:38,023 --> 00:22:39,692
Huh? What'd you say?

634
00:22:39,775 --> 00:22:41,986
[MOMO] Once Fushigi
concludes his mission

635
00:22:42,069 --> 00:22:43,362
to collect every curse mark,

636
00:22:43,445 --> 00:22:45,364
your friend
and partner will perish.

637
00:22:45,447 --> 00:22:48,242
If it would help you,
I would be happy to tell you

638
00:22:48,325 --> 00:22:50,244
if that was the truth
or a deception.

639
00:22:51,078 --> 00:22:52,204
Can it, clanker?

640
00:22:52,288 --> 00:22:53,747
[MOMO] I can be of use to you.

641
00:22:54,540 --> 00:22:56,667
I'm a very special
version of MOMO.

642
00:22:57,167 --> 00:22:58,502
[chiming]

643
00:22:59,879 --> 00:23:01,714
Look who it is. About time.

644
00:23:01,797 --> 00:23:03,591
[FUSHIGI] What are you
doing in there?

645
00:23:04,300 --> 00:23:05,676
Wishing I was hard of smelling.

646
00:23:05,759 --> 00:23:07,177
[FUSHIGI] So, where's the phone?

647
00:23:07,261 --> 00:23:08,554
Sorry, pal.

648
00:23:08,637 --> 00:23:09,972
I was tossed
before I could grab it.

649
00:23:10,055 --> 00:23:12,016
[FUSHIGI] You'd better
not be lying again.

650
00:23:12,099 --> 00:23:13,183
Of course, I ain't!

651
00:23:13,851 --> 00:23:15,394
You don't sense a curse, do you?

652
00:23:15,477 --> 00:23:17,563
No. Can't say I do.

653
00:23:18,188 --> 00:23:19,231
That's a shame.

654
00:23:19,315 --> 00:23:21,191
We'll have to wait
until someone else

655
00:23:21,275 --> 00:23:23,527
downloads the rogue app
and then try this again.

656
00:23:23,944 --> 00:23:25,738
[FUSHIGI] Let's go,
to the next town.

